OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening with some
OL,7,Flight showers. Persistent and
OL,8,Foccasionally heavy rain spreads east
OL,9,Fto all parts overnight. Some blustery
OL,10,Fwinds developing at times.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FCloudy to start with
OL,13,Fpersistent and occasionally heavy
OL,14,Frain, and some blustery winds at
OL,15,Ftimes. This clears through the morning
OL,16,Fto allow increasing bright spells, and
OL,17,Fsome showers in east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
