OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,Fand bright Thursday morning, then
OL,7,Fcloud and rain passing southeast in
OL,8,Fthe evening. Friday will become dry
OL,9,Fwith sunny spells. Mostly dry, bright
OL,10,FSaturday, some showers in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
